 side. Four young people whose intertwined destinies challenge love, sacrifice, and the possibility of rewriting the past.</p>", "updated": 1790433278, "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/93826"}, "previousepisode": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3718027", "name": "Episode 10"}, "nextepisode": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3718028", "name": "Episode 11"}}}}}, {"id": 3790183, "url": "https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3790183/small-town-remedy-1x11-episode-11", "name": "Episode 11", "season": 1, "number": 11, "type": "regular", "airdate": "2026-10-25", "airtime": "", "airstamp": "2026-10-25T04:00:00+00:00", "runtime": null, "rating": {"average": null}, "image": null, "summary": null, "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3790183"}, "show": {"href": "https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87713", "name": "Small Town Remedy"}}, "_embedded": {"show": {"id": 87713, "url": "https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/87713/small-town-remedy", "name": "Small Town Remedy", "type": "Scripted", "language": "Chinese", "genres": ["Drama", "Medical"], "status": "Running", "runtime": null, "averageRuntime": 46, "premiered": "2026-10-21", "ended": null, "officialSite": "https://www.iqiyi.com/a_13jun9wzsv9.html", "schedule": {"time": "19:30", "days": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]}, "rating": {"average": null}, "weight": 59, "network": {"id": 297, "name": "CCTV-8", "country": {"name": "China", "code": "CN", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai"}, "officialSite": null}, "webChannel": {"id": 67, "name": "iQIYI", "country": null, "officialSite": "https://www.iq.com/"}, "dvdCountry": null, "externals": {"tvrage": null, "thetvdb": null, "imdb": null}, "image": {"medium": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/646/1616065.jpg", "original": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/646/1616065.jpg"}, "summary": "<p>This series tells the story of Liu Zhengliang (Played by Xia